# Interactive suffix for the shared HP49/50 Stock USB launch sequence.
# Offsets are relative to its host gate; PrRUN is pressed at 32500 ms.
# The compact payload starts on Native/minifont. DOWN selects Native/main;
# RIGHT selects the representative generated face, then ON exits normally.
44000 capture gallery-native-mini
45500 tap down
47000 capture gallery-native-main
48500 tap right
50000 capture gallery-generated-control
51500 tap on
